# The boundary, restated 2026-08-24.  It used to read "none of Kiraly Jozsef's
# own files live in this repository".  That is still true of the EMULATED half:
# the DOS programs, the memory image and the speech data they read stay out,
# ship inside the released .nvda-addon, and are archived in full at the Internet
# Archive.  See the README for where to get them.
#
# It is no longer true of kiraly/.  In August 2026 the author rewrote all three
# editions in Python himself and asked that they be published -- "nyugodtan
# felteheti oket" -- so his rewrites and the data they read are tracked here,
# with his permission and under his name.  Publishing code he wrote to be
# published is the opposite of the thing the old rule guarded against.
addon/synthDrivers/_pctalker_engine/OLVASSP.EXE
addon/synthDrivers/_pctalker_engine/READSPF.EXE
addon/synthDrivers/_pctalker_engine/engine.bin
engine.bin
original/

# Bundled at build time by tools/build_addon.py, straight from site-packages.
# Roughly 3 MB of unicorn.dll that we do not maintain and should not vendor.
addon/synthDrivers/_pctalker_engine/lib/

# Built packages go to Releases, not into the tree -- ours and his alike.
*.nvda-addon

# Scratch: capture rigs, rendered wavs, DOSBox working copies.
work/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
